meta {
  name: Generate Marketing
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/marketings/generate
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  image: @file()
  templateId: 1
  headline: Nyári klíma akció szereléssel!
  acUnitName: Gree Comfort Pro 3.5 kW
  details: Telepítéssel, 10 év garanciával
  fullPrice: 289000
  showLogo: true
  showPhone: true
}

script:post-response {
  const createdId = res.body?.id ?? res.body?.[0]?.id;
  if (res.status === 200 && createdId) {
    bru.setVar("marketingId", createdId);
  }
}

docs {
  # Generate Marketing
  Uploads a generated marketing creative image to the Supabase `Marketing` storage bucket and persists its metadata for the authenticated user. Automatically rolls back the uploaded file if database insertion fails.

  ### Authentication
  - **Bearer Token** required (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`).

  ### Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  - `image` (file, required): Image file (`image/*` MIME type only, maximum **10 MB**).
  - `acUnitName` (string, required): Air conditioner model name.
  - `fullPrice` (integer/string, required): Positive integer price (`0` to `2147483647`, digits only).
  - `templateId` (string | number, optional): Reference ID of the selected template.
  - `headline` (string, optional): Main promotional headline text.
  - `details` (string, optional): Secondary promotional details.
  - `showLogo` (boolean/string, optional): Must be `true` or `false` if provided.
  - `showPhone` (boolean/string, optional): Must be `true` or `false` if provided.

  ### Responses
  - `200 OK`: Returns the created marketing record object.
  - `400 Bad Request`: Missing image, non-image MIME type, file larger than 10 MB, missing `acUnitName`/`fullPrice`, invalid integer price, or invalid `showLogo`/`showPhone` flag.
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Missing or invalid JWT token.
  - `500 Internal Server Error`: Unexpected error while uploading or saving the marketing record (`{ "message": "Hiba történt a hirdetés mentése során." }`).
}